[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_9997","text":"振兴会的大叔"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0010","text":"……那就这样，当天就按这个流程来\n拜托各位了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0020","text":"我们这边才是……！\n请多关照"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0030","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0040","text":"…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_9998","text":"振兴会的大妈"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0050","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0060","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0070","text":"……那个"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0080","text":"……诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0090","text":"啊，是２８３的……！\n辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0100","text":"辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0110","text":"？\n怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0120","text":"我来帮忙"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0130","text":"诶？不用不用\n这是我自作主张在做的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0140","text":"我也可以吗？\n如果允许我自作主张的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0150","text":"啊，这样吗……？\n呵呵，那多不好意思呀"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0160","text":"不……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0170","text":"嗯，那这样吧……\n你能从那边开始扫吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0180","text":"好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_9999","text":"同班同学"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0190","text":"……咦\n樋口同学？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_06_0200","text":"…………"}]
